    "%lld a game, one slide back at a time. Not once the game is over." : {

    },
    "%lld minutes to score all you can. A new row drops every %lld seconds whatever you shoot, a second sooner each wave down to every %lld, and a miss only ends the streak. It scores faster, so its points pay %lld%% each, and it keeps its own best." : {
